{"tool_name":"multilayer_extraction","contents":["oeb","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"Multilayer_Extraction","home":"https://github.com/jdwilson4/MultilayerExtraction","summary":"Community Extraction in Multilayer Networks with Heterogeneous Community Structure.\n\nAn R package to identify strongly connected vertex-layer communities in multilayer networks.\n\nAn R package that implements the multilayer extraction algorithm to identify densely connected vertex-layer sets in multilayer networks.\n\nmultilayer.extraction(): identify densely connected vertex-layer communities within multilayer networks. This is a significance based approach that seeks to optimize a score derived from the strength of connection within multilayer communities. See the above reference for more details.","addition_date":"2020-01-14T20:07:45Z","last_update_date":"2020-12-29T10:49:54Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:Multilayer_Extraction","credit":[{"email":"JDWILSON4@USFCA.EDU","name":"James D. Wilson","typeEntity":"Person"},{"name":"John Palowitch","typeEntity":"Person"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"public"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Clustering","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3432"},{"term":"Visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0337"}]}],"name":"Multilayer Extraction","owner":"Pub2Tools","publication":[{"pmcid":"PMC6927681","pmid":"31871433"}],"validated":1},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:multilayer_extraction/cmd/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":true,"interpreted":true,"license":false,"public":true,"readme":true,"repository":{"anonymous":true,"online":true}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":6,"citatio